WEBVTT

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:13.610
I yield!
I'll apologize for calling you a kid.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.780
I'm Ibrahim of Hisar.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:17.950
What's your name?

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:20.450
I am Mahmut of the Tuğril tribe.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.410
The Citadel City

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:44.390
Altair: A Record of Battles

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:56.760
This year's military tests...

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:58.010
There's so many!

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:01.890
They're going to spend the next year training
in cadet school, right?

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:03.180
That's reassuring.

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:05.390
The one in front got top marks, didn't he?

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:09.190
Seriously? Just how old is he?

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:10.560
I heard he's 12.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.900
He's younger than my kid?

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.400
I couldn't wait.

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:18.280
I couldn't wait to become Pasha.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:20.660
At least, that's what I thought.

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:25.120
He never talks to anyone.

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:29.370
And he's always hanging out
with his bird between class.

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:34.630
But he gets real enthusiastic when it comes to drills.

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:37.050
That's the only time he ever speaks up.

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:41.260
I really hate how condescending he is.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:44.810
I couldn't stand to have war
break out somewhere

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:46.680
without me knowing

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.850
and losing people important to me

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:50.270
without knowing why.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:52.150
They're here!

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:55.650
Ali and Isaach, go left.
Bola and Tarukan, go right.

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:59.070
-We'll attack the black captain from three angles.
-Hey, Mahmut!

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:01.490
We've got our own thoughts too.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:04.450
Your ideas aren't always going to be what's right.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:20.340
When you become Pasha,
you must lead thousands of men.

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:24.760
If you can't even get four people
to follow you,

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:28.350
then you're going to have
a hard time standing at the top.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:34.520
What an idiot. I can't believe you got hurt
during a horsemanship competition.

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:39.530
If you just conceded, then your opponents--

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:45.910
Am I not suited for this, Ibrahim?

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:49.620
Can someone who can't even lead four people

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:52.040
ever hope to become Pasha?

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:57.300
Well, I don't know if you're suited for it or not.

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:00.090
But you're working harder than anyone.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:02.340
Anybody can see that.

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:04.800
Just as you want to become Pasha,

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:09.470
my goal is to become
the Vali of my hometown Hisar.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:12.310
While ability is important for being
Pasha or Vali,

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.600
I think the job should go to the person

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:19.320
who wants it so bad that they work harder
than everyone else.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:23.570
The only thing you're missing
is cooperation, right?

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:27.870
So you may be younger than me,
but you're my role model.

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:30.580
I bet you didn't know that, Master Mahmut.

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:33.790
Ibrahim.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:37.420
The only reason I am standing here now as Pasha

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:40.510
is because of the words you gave me. Yet...

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:43.630
What? A revolt in Hisar?

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:48.010
Ibrahim Vali joined forces with the Araba Tribe
and declared their independence.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:53.310
The Vali's 1000-man-strong tribunal forces
formed an alliance with the Araba tribesmen

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:56.520
and mounted their revolt using the
festival to their advantage.

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:59.730
They attacked at dawn,
taking control of a merchant's mansion

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:03.740
and banished the prominent merchants
to the town of Oasis.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:06.200
After declaring martial law,

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:10.080
they announced the establishment
of the independent state of Hisar.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:13.580
Ibrahim in an uprising?

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:18.170
Hisar is an important hub
for our nation's first province.

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:20.800
We must take back control at once.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:21.960
No!

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.670
The First Province is under my jurisdiction.

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:28.640
I would like to take charge of this matter
in order to defend my honor.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:32.430
Fortunately, the 4000 men
in my First Province Forces

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:34.810
are already armed and in the capital.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:38.310
I shall lead these troops
to suppress the rebellion,

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:41.270
and take back control of Hisar.

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:52.450
Hey, is that true?

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:54.450
They said we have our own country now!

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:56.540
I heard everyone is heading to Hisar.

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:59.210
This isn't a dream, is it?

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:08.970
-Listen up, men--
-Please wait!

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:10.300
Zaganos Pasha!

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:14.470
Ibrahim Vali would never start an uprising!

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.270
Whether you think it's possible or not,

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.310
there is in fact a rebellion.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:25.780
Could you first investigate the
circumstances surrounding the rebellion?

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:29.660
I cannot imagine that fighting our own countrymen
would be in our interest!

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:32.160
Are you unable to see the situation?

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:35.870
Hisar is Torqye's shield against the Empire.

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:38.250
And if that declared independence,

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:42.040
it will give the Empire
the perfect reason to attack it.

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:47.630
If that happens, then there would be nothing
standing in the way of the Empire.

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:51.300
We have to take back Hisar immediately.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.560
You yourself selected Ibrahim to become Vali!

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:58.100
You should know if he's the type of man
who would instigate a rebellion.

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:02.690
-There has to be something behind this.
-If that's the case, this is the perfect opportunity.

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:07.190
This will finally open the eyes
of those fools blinded by peace.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:13.530
There is a power that would drive the virtuous
Ibrahim Vali to rebellion.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.830
And we are about to find out what.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.540
All forces, march!

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:23.880
Wait.

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:26.380
Did Zaganos Pasha already know?

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:31.800
Already know that there
would be a rebellion in Hisar?

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:34.600
Now, then.

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.640
It's a race against time.

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:40.850
Hurry! We will put an end to this in two days!

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:51.240
Good evening, Mahmut Pasha.

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:53.570
-Shara?
-I already heard.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:54.910
You're going to Hisar?

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:56.830
I'm not going for fun!

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:58.330
Oh, what a coincidence.

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:01.290
I was about to go save my friend too.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:05.540
Do what you want.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:10.300
I can be quite useful to you.

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:13.050
Let's go, Iskender!

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:23.770
Ibrahim.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:28.820
You're not the type of person
who would put your home in danger.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.150
What has happened?

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:36.320
There was a rebellion in Hisar,

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:41.450
and Ibrahim Vali has apparently declared themselves
an independent state with the Araba Tribe.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:46.710
We should send our forces with the pretense
of safeguarding the Araba people.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:52.010
Once our pretense is in place,
we will secure public opinion,

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:54.720
allowing us to officially claim Hisar
as our territory.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:58.220
The people of Torqye are not fools.

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:02.520
They will not wait for the arrival of our troops.

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:06.190
Well, as it so happens,

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:09.820
the 10,000 Ell Mountain Infantrymen
led by Duchess Lelederik

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:14.280
are only one day's journey away from Hisar
after deploying for training yesterday.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:18.910
I would like permission to send a signal
after sundown.

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:24.870
How fortunate for the Empire that so many
things seem to be working in our favor.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:30.880
This is all by the grace of St. Michael.

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:50.730
Pardon me.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:53.610
So if we do as you say,

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:57.820
you will safely deliver all of our families to Altin?

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:00.950
That I vow.

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:03.580
I apologize for all of the trouble
we've caused.

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:05.540
However, creating a nation,

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:09.290
and being able to live with
my scattered compatriots again

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:12.500
is something the Araba have desired
for the last 100 years.

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:17.420
Torqyes sure are careless.

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:23.470
To think that all it took was an invitation to a special
free Araba performance for the military families

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:28.390
to trick a thousand soldiers into allowing

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:31.440
their families be taken hostage so easily.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.940
You must have had a happy life.

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:48.290
This is our new nation...

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:51.000
Why am I disguised as a woman?

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:52.590
What choice did we have?

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:54.920
This is all I could put together.

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:03.600
I see.

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:07.640
All of their families have been taken hostage.

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:10.640
-That smells like oil.
-What?

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:14.520
I am guessing the entire tent has been soaked in oil.

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:17.360
One spark would engulf it in flames.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:21.280
What? The Araba Tribe would never
do something so cruel!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:27.830
There is a power that would drive the virtuous
Ibrahim Vali to rebellion.

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:31.830
Ibrahim.

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.010
We have trouble!

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:47.430
Two thousand zillas to our southeast!

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:51.770
Torqye forces led by Zaganos Pasha
are marching towards us!

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:52.940
What?

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:55.440
That is not what we were promised!

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:57.980
There was not supposed to be any fighting.

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:08.410
All that's needed of us is to wait for the arrival
of the Imperial forces.

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:10.410
Do you understand,

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:12.250
Ibrahim Vali?

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:15.330
I understand.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:21.260
I will not allow Zaganos' forces to enter
until the imperial forces arrive.

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:24.300
So please,

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:27.300
promise me you will lead these families
out of the city alive.

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:36.810
That outfit looks good on you.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:39.440
Sorry,

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.440
Mahmut.

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:46.280
What was that?

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:48.450
Is Ibrahim planning to die?

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:52.580
I won't let that happen!

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:59.420
They will attack as soon as they finish
building their siege weapons.

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:01.260
Once the morning star rises,

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:03.010
I want you armed with bows!

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:05.260
Draw them in within 100 zillas,

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:07.300
and fire all in unison!

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:11.430
Torqye soldiers led by Zaganos Pasha.

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:12.600
Seriously,

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:14.520
we are outclassed and outmanned.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:19.520
I doubt that we have any hope of winning.

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:23.570
They turn Hisar's only armed forces,

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.070
and play up a rebellion.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:29.280
Whoever planned this was quite clever,

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:33.870
but we can overpower Ibrahim's
1000 soldiers within a day.

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:39.290
The issue is the Imperial forces that are assuredly
going to take this opportunity to intervene.

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:41.000
The Araba Tribe

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:43.960
is an ethnic group that mostly
resides in the Empire.

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:50.010
Their goal should be to intervene
on the pretense of defending their people.

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:55.430
So they should have been desperate to
enter Hisar before any Torqye forces.

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:59.020
An opponent who would set up these moves

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:02.940
was likely planning to use the forces
of a nearby lord to beat us here

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:07.950
rather than the Imperial forces
that would take too long to arrive.

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:15.500
However, not a single Imperial soldier has arrived.

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:17.160
How unfortunate.

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:19.960
It appears that the victory is mine.

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:24.090
I want the strike forces to take breaks
on rotation until dawn.

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:27.470
I need the engineers to complete
the siege towers by then!

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:29.970
We will take Hisar within a day!

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:32.050
Ibrahim Vali.

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:35.720
You and your men will have to die.

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:41.020
Unfortunately, it will take something powerful
to open the eyes of the Divan.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:42.520
I have an urgent message!

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:43.980
What is it?

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:46.150
A large group of Arabas are approaching.

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:48.200
It appears they have crossed the border.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:51.120
Their estimated number is 40,000!

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:54.790
Hurry, we've been cleared to march to Hisar!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:57.620
We must send the message
to Duchess Lelederik before dawn!

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:03.960
Minister Louis!

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:07.510
Duchess Lelederik has signaled
that Torqye forces

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:10.180
have reached Hisar first.

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:20.600
We have been beaten to the punch, Lady Lelederik.

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:24.060
It seems Louis needs to work on his endgame.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:27.690
Put out the signal fire
and wait for the minister's orders.

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:33.870
Shall we kill him and start this battle already?

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:35.280
Well.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:37.450
That does not sound bad.

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:50.670
I was able to beat the Empire to Hisar.

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:53.140
But what of it?

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:55.010
How did I not see this coming?

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:58.890
Forty thousand Araba tribesmen
are heading this way?

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:00.680
I see.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:03.520
That is what's stopped Zaganos' forces.

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:05.730
If it weren't for that,

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:08.030
they would have attacked by now.

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:10.990
But now that I think about it,

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:14.660
Zaganos Pasha's presence here was not
something the Empire expected.

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.330
If we opened the gates right now

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:19.410
to let Zaganos' forces into the city

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:22.660
wouldn't that solve everything?

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:25.290
Even the hostages could...

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:26.880
If things go well...

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:37.470
There is no way I could take that risk!

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:39.010
Vali.

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:41.680
I don't have any family in this city.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:48.980
But the tribunal forces have truly welcomed us
new recruits when we were transferred here.

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:54.110
We would spend the night after a mission
at someone's house.

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:56.570
I'm so happy to have met everyone here.

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:58.580
Those people in that tent

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:01.580
are my family too.

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:08.590
We can take down Zaganos Pasha together.
Right?

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:12.840
I...

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:17.300
I am asking them to die...

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:19.810
Mahmut...

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:24.850
I don't think I'm going to be able to become
the Vali I always wanted to be.

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:31.730
What are you doing?

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:34.190
You are not with the others, are you?

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:37.320
As you can see, we are dancers.

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:42.950
We rushed over from Oasis because we heard
there was a new Araba nation here.

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:45.750
Oh, well, welcome, then!

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.330
Hey, everyone, come over here!

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:49.540
Thank you.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.800
I'm glad someone who can speak
Araban is here.

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:55.510
I told you that bringing me here was
the best decision you could make.

00:17:56.930 --> 00:17:58.090
You came from Oasis?

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:00.050
These girls did?

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:03.600
To think this day would actually come,
it's like a dream come true!

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:06.270
How was this miracle possible?

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:09.980
Well, we can hardly believe it either.

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:13.570
This was all the Empire's minister's idea to begin with.

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:15.530
The Empire?

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:22.580
He's the one who gave us instruction
on what to do in Hisar.

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:28.710
It's that minister's men
who are in charge of things here.

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:39.300
What's going on?

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:41.600
There's a lot of noise coming from outside.

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:52.150
Let's thank the people from the Empire

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:57.610
and dance for them to show our appreciation
until the army arrives!

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:04.370
Just how carefree are these people?

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:06.660
-Go stop them.
-Yes, sir.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.210
People of Araba!

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:14.000
Do not be fooled by the Empire!

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:19.010
The Empire lied about giving us our own nation!

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:21.180
The Empire is only using us

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:24.300
so they can take this city for themselves!

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:27.180
He's freaking fluent.

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:31.770
Eleanor, watch the tent.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:34.230
Don't lie!

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:36.610
The minister promised us!

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:38.240
I am not lying!

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:40.900
I overheard someone from the Empire say just that!

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:43.870
If you don't believe me, then ask them yourselves!

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:58.590
There is nowhere to run now.

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:03.090
Did you not consider that you were
the one being lured here?

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:06.850
How dare you set Ibrahim up.

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:09.980
If your plan was to lure me here,

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:12.600
then that must mean you are confident
in your skills.

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:16.150
Was this another plot from Minister Louis?

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:17.900
That sword...

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:20.650
I see, you are a soldier for the Stratocracy.

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:22.820
Judging from what you've said,

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:27.120
I am guessing you are an acquaintance
who has come to save Ibrahim Vali.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.370
He is my friend.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:35.080
To think you would challenge a man
of unknown skills to a duel, all for a friend.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.460
Do you not think that foolish?

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:41.840
A soldier never fears a battle!

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:46.300
I'll say this for your benefit,
but that man is not worth saving.

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:52.310
He prioritized his own personal feelings
over his duty as Vali.

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:54.100
He has failed as a Vali.

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:57.400
And you who have come to save him,

00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:00.110
are not fit to be a soldier either.

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:19.290
Sword of the Röd Orm?

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:22.260
Your skills are respectable.

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:25.430
I see no need for me to risk danger here.

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:26.930
Drop your sword.

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:31.140
If I blow this whistle,
my men will set fire to the tent.

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:35.690
That is how you must have forced Ibrahim to comply.

00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:37.270
That's right.

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:41.270
But there is no need
to prepare for your death just yet.

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:49.120
You must only kill your enemy after
making them regret ever becoming your enemy.

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:52.290
This sword was made for that purpose.

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:56.210
Yes, let's see.

00:21:56.370 --> 00:22:00.790
I shall let you live until the Imperial forces
walk through these city gates.

00:22:02.090 --> 00:22:03.670
Although,

00:22:03.840 --> 00:22:07.840
you will soon pray for the Imperial forces' arrival.

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:11.810
Despite being a soldier for the Stratocracy.

00:23:48.610 --> 00:23:50.650
I've decided to help my friend.

00:23:50.820 --> 00:23:52.320
Forgetting who I was.

00:23:53.200 --> 00:23:58.160
That sacrifice was ever so unreal.
Next episode, "The Council of Generals."

00:23:58.500 --> 00:24:02.080
The Golden Eagle that lost its wing
will start walking alone.
